  "headline": "Tre Jones Is Wrecking Zero Fox Given",
  "subhead": "A free-agent point guard has Suggs to be you up 8-3 in a matchup that was tied 5-5 without him.",
  "zingers": [
   {
    "team": "Suggs to be you",
    "line": "Tre Jones gave up nothing but an open roster spot and delivered 26 points and 17 assists, flipping PTS and AST from a 5-5 tie."
