   {
    "team": "Zero Fox Given",
    "line": "Trailing 8-3 with 10 starts left against Suggs' 12, they are watching a waiver-wire guard they ignored bury them in points and assists."
   },
   {
    "team": "Gopher Gold",
    "line": "Gopher Gold lead theInfamous 7-3 right now, riding Devin Vassell's 7 threes and Matisse Thybulle's 4 steals, though 6-4 was the baseline without them."
   },
   {
    "team": "theInfamous",
    "line": "theInfamous hold 13 starts to Gopher Gold's 12 and the only hope of climbing back from 3-7, which is the weakest comfort in the league."
   },
   {
    "team": "Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw",
    "line": "Down 8-3 to BrookynDynasty with 10 starts left against 12, they are losing on the scoreboard and in the schedule."
   },
   {
    "team": "MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f",
    "line": "Scottie Barnes has 34 points tonight and Tyler Herro sits among the week's top players, yet MONSTARS are only tied 5-5 with Thug Life."
   },
   {
    "team": "Thug Life",
    "line": "Jaden McDaniels is the week's top player, but Jeremiah Fears chipped in 2 points on 1-of-6 shooting tonight to keep MONSTARS level."
